## Reusable knowledge

- Use three categories: physics-based benchmark/environment; evaluation harness; learned world-model evaluator. RoboDoj
o is the likely Tianxing Chen work: 42 simulation and 18 real-world tasks across Generalization, Memory, Precision, Lon
g-Horizon, and Open; it adds bimanual evaluation, partial-progress scoring, hidden verification layouts, Isaac Sim, and
