ss. SIMPLER tests whether simulated rankings correlate with real-world rankings. VLABench emphasizes implicit language,
 world knowledge, semantic reasoning, long horizon, and object diversity; RoboCasa365 emphasizes household/mobile scale
. [Task 1]
- `vla-eval` is infrastructure, not a harder benchmark. WorldEval, WorldGym, and dWorldEval are learned world-model eva
luators. Recommended design: retain standard LIBERO for continuity; add LIBERO-Plus/PRO for robustness, VLABench/RoboDo
