- Do not say RoboDojo or RoboTwin is universally better than LIBERO: stated gains concern capability coverage, bimanual
 evaluation, randomization, sim-and-real protocol, or data scalability. Do not compare scores across unmatched policy, 
training data, action interface, seeds, episodes, termination rules, or environment versions. [Task 1]
- Treat learned world-model results as complementary evidence, not a correctness certificate: watch for hallucinated su
ccess, action-fidelity errors, temporal drift, generated-object artifacts, and reward-model bias. [Task 1]
- Symptom: Poppler fails on Windows. Cause: fallback path or `.cmd` wrapper cannot find its binary. Fix: use `...depend
encies\native\poppler\Library\bin`, or structural validation plus another rendering workflow. Symptom: a large patch co
nflicts on the same file. Fix: one update or non-conflicting patches. [Task 2]

